[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2101.19, "timestamp": "00:35:01", "text": "，主要是在我的網站上。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2105.75, "timestamp": "00:35:05", "text": "嗯，我的網站，也就是我的主頁 next.space，他們"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2109.43, "timestamp": "00:35:09", "text": "仍然會在那裡署名。嗯，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2112.63, "timestamp": "00:35:12", "text": "計劃在未來"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2117.99, "timestamp": "00:35:17", "text": "發布"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2123.43, "timestamp": "00:35:23", "text": "我的新模型等等之後，進行某種形式的拆分或其他操作。所以，這"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2126.71, "timestamp": "00:35:26", "text": "更像是一種分離，一方是那些曾經參與"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2129.75, "timestamp": "00:35:29", "text": "其中並"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2132.39, "timestamp": "00:35:32", "text": "為最初的系列作品創作了資產和衍生作品的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2135.67, "timestamp": "00:35:35", "text": "最初的系列算是比較老的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2138.15, "timestamp": "00:35:38", "text": "型號，而這款也是目前最新的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2140.79, "timestamp": "00:35:40", "text": "運動護襠設計。這也是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2143.67, "timestamp": "00:35:43", "text": "初始系列的一部分，呃，那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2145.43, "timestamp": "00:35:45", "text": "人將會在那裡獲得署名，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2148.069, "timestamp": "00:35:48", "text": "從那以後，新的運動型模特，那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2149.91, "timestamp": "00:35:49", "text": "製作粉絲藝術作品的人，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2153.27, "timestamp": "00:35:53", "text": "這些粉絲藝術作品等等，都會被"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2155.91, "timestamp": "00:35:55", "text": "發布，所有新篇章的貢獻者都會單獨獲得署名。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2158.95, "timestamp": "00:35:58", "text": "所以我就像是"}]